{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Woe, the multitude of many peoples.</b> The king of Assyria and his army, when he came against Zion." "<b>and the roar.</b> From the root שאון. The nun is not a root letter; it is like the nun of זדון (Proverbs 11:2)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:08.228502774Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}